IMPORT `P8-art78`



-- Tests of Article 78. Its group (Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78) applies from 2 August 2025 (Art 113).
`Art 78 test on` MEANS Date 2 8 2025
`Art 78 test before` MEANS Date 1 8 2025
`Art 78 test route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 78 test placed` MEANS Date 2 12 2027
