§ `Seam S14: Article 2(2) cuts off a provision about a high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products`

-- Added 2026-11-17 for seam S14 (fork F-S14-reach, assumed, not ruled). Each case is an existing case of this file with only the route and the two Section B facts changed.
-- Route Article 6(1) and Annex I with products covered by Section B: Article 2(2) says "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply", so the function answers JUST FALSE (a number: NOTHING; a rule: FULFILLED).
-- The integration fact (the second Section B input) matters to Articles 57 to 59 only, so it changes nothing here. Another route, or products not covered by Section B, leaves the function on its own provision.
-- Art 78(3) second subparagraph first sentence the technical documentation remains within the premises of the au
